# === Secrets — NEVER commit (Phase 0 hygiene) ===
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
token.json
client_secret.json
*credentials*.json
*secret*.json
*.pem
*.key

# === Phase 0 local-only artifacts (contain secret values / bulk) — never commit ===
PHASE0_SECURITY_REPORT.md

